url: "https://github.com/sergey-show/barney"
abstract: >-
  Barney is a self-developing LLM agent with an immutable Immune Core and a
  Plastic Body that grows through executable verification (ZPD-3 proofs),
  an experience-write law opened by prediction error, and a Four-Hand
  transfer protocol measuring body-causal transfer (ΔS). The kernel is
  immutable; the body lives in ~/.barney.
